  "integrations": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Workspace Users Guardrails Integrations Audit log Arjun NairWorkspace admin · Munchly Foods Integrations Integrations Munchly's sign-in, Google Cloud services and partner APIs Google Workspace SSO IdentityMunchly staff sign in with munchly.in accounts onlyconnectedTestFirebase Authentication IdentityPhone one-time codes for distributors and kiranas, by invitationconnectedTestFirebase Cloud Messaging PushWeb push to every role, in-app inbox as fallbackconnectedTestBigQuery DataBatches, sell-through by pincode and by shop, price historyconnectedTestCloud Pub/Sub Eventsbatch.at_risk, offer.received, deal.closedconnectedTestGemini on Vertex AI AgentsVision for labels, Pro for routing, Flash for chatconnectedTestDMS export (Bizom-style) InventoryNightly CSV, 312 batches across 4 distributorsconnectedTestTally invoice drafts AccountingDistributors issue the drafted invoices from their own TallymockedTestExpireSoon API MarketplaceMocked POST /v1/listings; partner API in talksmockedTestFood-bank partners DonationFeeding India and IFBN intake rulesmockedTest ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Arjun Nair · Workspace admin · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings⟩",
