  "integrations": "Integrations Integrations Munchly's sign-in, Google Cloud services and partner APIs Google Workspace SSO IdentityMunchly staff sign in with munchly.in accounts onlyconnectedTestFirebase Authentication IdentityPhone one-time codes for distributors and kiranas, by invitationconnectedTestFirebase Cloud Messaging PushWeb push to every role, in-app inbox as fallbackconnectedTestBigQuery DataBatches, sell-through by pincode and by shop, price historyconnectedTestCloud Pub/Sub Eventsbatch.at_risk, offer.received, deal.closedconnectedTestGemini on Vertex AI AgentsVision for labels, Pro for routing, Flash for chatconnectedTestDMS export (Bizom-style) InventoryNightly CSV, 312 batches across 4 distributorsconnectedTestTally invoice drafts AccountingDistributors issue the drafted invoices from their own TallymockedTestExpireSoon API MarketplaceMocked POST /v1/listings; partner API in talksmockedTestFood-bank partners DonationFeeding India and IFBN intake rulesmockedTest WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Main⟩",
  "profile": "Profile Profile Workspace admin Arjun Nair Workspace admin · Munchly FoodsGoogle Workspace · arjun.nair@munchly.in Workspace Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.comMunchly staffWorkspace settingsSign-in, supply-chain profile, branding Appearance ThemeLightDarkAuto Notifications LanguageEnglishहिन्दीPush notificationsWeekly digest by email Offers to the trade go out in the language each person picks. Account Switch personTry the journey as someone else in the story Reset demo dataPuts the batch back to the start Sign outBack to munchly.smartclearance.com WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Theme | Notification language | Push notifications | Weekly digest | Main⟩",
  "rules": "Guardrails Guardrails What the agents may and may not do in Munchly's name Floor price, % of MRP Snacks35%Biscuits35%Staples40%Beverages30%Personal care40% No channel sells below its category's floor. Approvals Routes per channel that need a tap10Require a label photo before pricing Territory guard Hide ExpireSoon listings from buyers inside Munchly's territories Matched by pincode against the four distributor territories. Offers and marketplace Kirana offers in HindiOffer window48 hBuyer token15%Scheme returns, days before best-before20 daysWatcher runs daily at09:00 Planning assumptions Scheme uplift on normal sales3.5×Van rate, a unit₹0.50 Used to size the kirana scheme and its cost. Write-off factors Disposal, a unit₹1.50EPR, a kg of product and pack₹6 Used for the true cost of destroying a batch. Both are indicative. Save guardrails WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Floor for snacks | Fewer Floor for snacks | More Floor for snacks | Floor for biscuits | Fewer Floor for biscuits | More Floor for biscuits | Floor for staples | Fewer Floor for staples | More Floor for staples | Floor for beverages | Fewer Floor for beverages | More Floor for beverages | Floor for personal-care | Fewer Floor for personal-care | More Floor for personal-care | Routes needing approval | Fewer Routes needing approval | More Routes needing approval | Require a label photo | Territory guard | Hindi offers | Offer window hours | Fewer Offer window hours | More Offer window hours | Token percent | Fewer Token percent | More Token percent | Return window | Fewer Return window | More Return window | Scheme uplift | Fewer Scheme uplift | More Scheme uplift | Van rate | Fewer Van rate | More Van rate | Disposal per unit | Fewer Disposal per unit | More Disposal per unit | EPR per kg | Fewer EPR per kg | More EPR per kg | Main⟩",
  "users": "Users Users People and partner organisations in Munchly Foods' workspace 9 active2 invited1 deactivatedInvite Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Google Workspaceactive Rakesh bhaiDistributor · Phone codeactive Ganesh jiKirana retailer · Phone codeactive MeeraFood-bank partner · Google, invitedactive Arjun NairWorkspace admin · Google Workspaceactive PDPatil DistributorsDistributor · Phone codeactive G&Gupta & SonsDistributor · Phone codeactive LALakshmi AgenciesDistributor · Phone codeactive JDJai Durga StoresKirana retailer · Phone codeactive KKKrishna Kirana BhandarKirana retailer · Phone codedeactivated SSShree Sai KiranaKirana retailer · Phone codeinvited IFIndia FoodBanking NetworkFood-bank partner · Google, invitedinvited Marketplace buyers sign in to ExpireSoon, another company's site. They are never members of this workspace. WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Search people, organisations, roles | Search people, organisations, roles | Actions for Priya Deshmukh | Actions for Priya Deshmukh | Actions for Rakesh bhai | Actions for Rakesh bhai | Actions for Ganesh ji | Actions for Ganesh ji | Actions for Meera | Actions for Meera | Actions for Arjun Nair | Actions for Arjun Nair | Actions for Patil Distributors | Actions for Patil Distributors | Actions for Gupta & Sons | Actions for Gupta & Sons | Actions for Lakshmi Agencies | Actions for Lakshmi Agencies | Actions for Jai Durga Stores | Actions for Jai Durga Stores | Actions for Krishna Kirana Bhandar | Actions for Krishna Kirana Bhandar | Actions for Shree Sai Kirana | Actions for Shree Sai Kirana | Actions for India FoodBanking Network | Actions for India FoodBanking Network | Main⟩",
  "workspace": "Workspace Workspace munchly.smartclearance.com · set up by Smart-Clearance for Munchly's supply chain Munchly Foods munchly.smartclearance.com live since 1 Jul 2026PilotIndia, Mumbai region2 staff · 7 partners Powered bySmart‑Clearance How people sign in Each workspace sets its own; these are Munchly's Google WorkspaceMunchly staff · munchly.in accounts onlyonMobile number and a one-time codeDistributors and kirana owners · Numbers Munchly or their distributor invitedonGoogle, by invitationPartners such as food banks · Addresses Munchly invitedon Marketplace buyersMarketplace buyers sign in to ExpireSoon, another company's site. They are never members of this workspace.outside Everyone signs in at the same address with an email or a phone number; the workspace picks the method. Branding The client's colours stay inside its mark Workspace markShown under the Smart-Clearance mark, on the sign-in page and in the workspace sheet NameMunchly Foods Addressmunchly.smartclearance.com Notifications arrive asSmart-Clearance IntegrationsSupply chain, as set up for Munchly Another manufacturer's workspace is set up for its own chain Munchly FoodsPune · sells only to distributors 4 distributorsown the stock they buy 195 kiranason the salesmen's beatsQuick-commerce warehousesBlinkit, Zepto, Instamart; turn short-dated stock away Route to market4 distributors. Munchly sells only to its distributors. Each one supplies the kiranas on his salesman's beat and the Blinkit, Zepto and Instamart warehouses in his city.Who owns short-dated stockThe distributor. He bought it at ₹22.00 a pack, so the agent lists, offers and invoices in his name, with his one-time permission.Expiry policyDestroyed at the distributor's godown. Packs left at a distributor's godown on expiry day are destroyed there by an authorised agency. Munchly approves the evidence and credits him the dealer price, the input GST he reverses and the agency's charges, so Munchly acts before expiry and pays price support instead of a claim.Quick-commerce gatesBlinkit 90+ days · Zepto, Instamart 60% of life. A batch that misses a gate stays in the distributor's godown.Exits for distributor stockFour, and the bin as the baseline. ExpireSoon, the kirana scheme, a staff sale at the godown and food banks. Discount D2C and the Pune plant staff sale apply only to Munchly's own warehouse stock.Territory guard4 territories. ExpireSoon listings are hidden from buyers inside Munchly's distributor territories, matched by pincode.Scheme returnsUntil 20 days before best-before. Returned packs reach the godown in time for a staff sale or a food bank. Distributors Rakesh TradersNagpur with Wardha and Kamptee · pincodes 440, 441, 442… · staff sale up to 50requestedPatil DistributorsPune · pincodes 411, 412… · staff sale up to 50granted · 1 OctGupta & SonsIndore · pincodes 452, 453… · staff sale up to 50granted · 1 OctLakshmi AgenciesHyderabad · pincodes 500, 501… · staff sale up to 150granted · 1 Oct Territories are matched by pincode for the territory guard; a godown may set its own staff-sale cap. Smart-Clearance sets up each manufacturer's workspace for its own supply chain: who owns short-dated stock, which exits exist, who approves and how people sign in. Changes to this profile go through Smart-Clearance onboarding; the guardrails, users and integrations are Munchly's to run. WorkspaceUsersGuardrailsAudit ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Munchly Foods sells to 4 distributors, who supply 195 kiranas and the Blinkit, Zepto and Instamart warehouses in their cities. | Main⟩",
}
`;

