  "setup": "Setup Setup Connect the stock data once and set the rules the agents must obey dms_export_2026-10-01.csvBizom-style DMS export · 312 batches · 4 distributorsMapped · confirm below Smart-Clearance fieldColumn in your fileStatusdistributordistributor_namemappedskuitem_codemappedbatchbatch_nomappedmfgmfg_datemappedbest beforebb_datemappedunitsclosing_qtymappedgodownlocationmappedpincodepinmapped Data Agent mapped 8 of 8 columns and back-filled 90 days of sell-through by pincode and by shop. Floor price by category Snacks₹10.50 on a ₹30 pack35%Biscuits₹14.00 on a ₹40 pack35%Staples₹22.00 on a ₹55 pack40%Beverages₹6.00 on a ₹20 pack30%Personal care₹48.00 on a ₹120 pack40% No channel may sell below its category's floor. Territory guard Nagpur with Wardha and KampteeRakesh Traders · pincodes 440, 441, 442…PunePatil Distributors · pincodes 411, 412…IndoreGupta & Sons · pincodes 452, 453…HyderabadLakshmi Agencies · pincodes 500, 501… Hide listings inside the territories ExpireSoon listings are hidden from buyers inside these territories, matched by pincode, so clearance stock never undercuts a Munchly distributor. Approval policy Routes per channel that need a tap10 Personal care never goes to food banks Premium gift packs never go to a staff sale After that the agents run inside the guardrails and report. Channel allow-list CategoryExpireSoonKiranasStaff saleFood banksnacksAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbiscuitsAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedstaplesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedbeveragesAllowedAllowedAllowedAllowedpersonal careAllowedAllowedAllowedNever Discount D2C applies only to Munchly's own warehouse stock. A distributor's stock is his, so it never goes to Munchly's own site. Distributors' one-time permission Rakesh TradersNagpurrequestedPatil DistributorsPunegranted · 1 OctGupta & SonsIndoregranted · 1 OctLakshmi AgenciesHyderabadgranted · 1 Oct Each distributor lets the agent list his Munchly stock, offer schemes to his kiranas, draft his invoices and book dispatch slots, inside Munchly's floors. He can pause it at any time. Give the permission as Rakesh bhai Scheme returns and planning Kiranas may return scheme packs until29 Oct for this batch20 days before Scheme uplift on normal sales3.5× Van rate, a unit₹0.50 The uplift and the van rate are planning assumptions. The return window lets returned packs reach the godown in time for a staff sale or a food bank. Feeding Indiapartner 15+ days left · at least 50 units · Volunteer pickup within 48 h, hunger spots in 100+ citiesIn-app receiptIndia FoodBanking Networkpartner 21+ days left · at least 100 units · Drop at a member warehouse or a scheduled pickupDonation acknowledgement (CSR / 80G, indicative) The true cost of a write-offshown before any batch is routed Stock at cost₹16.00+ GST credit reversed₹0.90+ Disposal₹1.50+ EPR, indicative₹0.96 = Destroying, a unitminus ₹19.36−₹19.36 For Masala Chips 150 g: cost ₹16; ₹0.90 of input GST a packet from the cost sheet (chips are at 5% GST since GST 2.0); disposal ₹1.50 a unit; EPR ₹6 a kilo of product and pack. Factors marked indicative are editable here. Confirm and start watching TodayBatchesLedger ⟨Munchly Foods workspace, on Smart-Clearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Field mapping | Floor for Snacks | Fewer Floor for Snacks | More Floor for Snacks | Floor for Biscuits | Fewer Floor for Biscuits | More Floor for Biscuits | Floor for Staples | Fewer Floor for Staples | More Floor for Staples | Floor for Beverages | Fewer Floor for Beverages | More Floor for Beverages | Floor for Personal care | Fewer Floor for Personal care | More Floor for Personal care | Territory guard | routes | Fewer routes | More routes | Personal care never to food banks | Gift packs never to staff sale | Channel rules by category | days before best-before | Fewer days before best-before | More days before best-before | Scheme uplift | Fewer Scheme uplift | More Scheme uplift | Van rate | Fewer Van rate | More Van rate | Main⟩",
}
`;

