  "rules": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Workspace Users Guardrails Integrations Audit log Arjun NairWorkspace admin · Munchly Foods Guardrails Save Guardrails What the agents may and may not do in Munchly's name Floor price, % of MRP Snacks35%Biscuits35%Staples40%Beverages30%Personal care40% No channel sells below its category's floor. Approvals Routes per channel that need a tap10Require a label photo before pricing Territory guard Hide ExpireSoon listings from buyers inside Munchly's territories Matched by pincode against the four distributor territories. Offers and marketplace Kirana offers in HindiOffer window48 hBuyer token15%Scheme returns, days before best-before20 daysWatcher runs daily at09:00 Planning assumptions Scheme uplift on normal sales3.5×Van rate, a unit₹0.50 Used to size the kirana scheme and its cost. Write-off factors Disposal, a unit₹1.50EPR, a kg of product and pack₹6 Used for the true cost of destroying a batch. Both are indicative. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Arjun Nair · Workspace admin · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Floor for snacks | Fewer Floor for snacks | More Floor for snacks | Floor for biscuits | Fewer Floor for biscuits | More Floor for biscuits | Floor for staples | Fewer Floor for staples | More Floor for staples | Floor for beverages | Fewer Floor for beverages | More Floor for beverages | Floor for personal-care | Fewer Floor for personal-care | More Floor for personal-care | Routes needing approval | Fewer Routes needing approval | More Routes needing approval | Require a label photo | Territory guard | Hindi offers | Offer window hours | Fewer Offer window hours | More Offer window hours | Token percent | Fewer Token percent | More Token percent | Return window | Fewer Return window | More Return window | Scheme uplift | Fewer Scheme uplift | More Scheme uplift | Van rate | Fewer Van rate | More Van rate | Disposal per unit | Fewer Disposal per unit | More Disposal per unit | EPR per kg | Fewer EPR per kg | More EPR per kg⟩",
