stamart Coconut Hair Oil 200 mlSafe Gupta & Sons · Indore· GL-2410-012 500 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Agent activity Every hand-off, as it happens Rakesh bhaiperson09:19 Sent one photo of the carton label from shelf B4. Visionagent09:20 Read the label: batch MF-2409-117, MFG 18 May 2026, best before 18 Nov 2026, MRP ₹30.00, confidence 0.97. Matches the DMS record. gemini.vision.read_label→confidence 0.97dms.reconcile→match Valueragent09:21 Priced five channels against 47 days left. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit, −₹26,330 for the batch. bigquery.price_history→snacks · 47 daysgst.rate→HSN 2005 → 5%cost_sheet.input_gst→₹0.90 a packepr.factor→₹6 / kg Routeragent09:22 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective, capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days; 772 to ExpireSoon at ₹15. The Nagpur staff sale pays less a unit, so it gets nothing this time. allocate.greedy→1,360 units → net ₹21,770 Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117, at Execute | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g | Stages | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 0 ordered | 22 of 180 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 22 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 22 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 22 | 47 of 180 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 47 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Sells out in 48 days; retailers take it for 54 more days | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 61 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 61 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 61 | Sells out in 47 da