  "execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Batches SetupIn a journey · 1 Masala ChipsExecuteReports Ledger Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Masala Chips · Execution Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Listing live · 0 of 31 kiranas ordered JourneyRoute Room, doneExecution, where the batch isPaperwork, after the lines closeMF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Lister · ExpireSoonqueued POST /v1/listings { "seller": "Rakesh Traders, Nagpur", "on_behalf": "one-time permission · inside Munchly floors", "sku": "MF-MC-150", "batch": "MF-2409-117", "units": 772, "price": 15.00, "reserve": 13.50, "mrp": 30.00, "best_before": "2026-11-18", "hide_from_pincodes": ["440", "441", "442", "411", "412", "452", "453", "500", "501"], "label_photo": "gs://smart-clearance/labels/MF-2409-117.jpg" } The marketplace is mocked; the request and response are what a partner API returns. Buyers in Munchly's territories never see the lot. Outreach · 38 kiranaspush · Hindi 000123456789 / 38kiranas ordered 000123456789 / 588units ItwariMahalSitabuldiSadarDharampethKampteeWardha RoadWardhaKalamna godown Schematic map · not to scale Orders arrive as shops tap the offer. No shop can order more than 4× its own 14-day sales. Negotiatorreserve ₹13.50 · hidden Waiting for a bid from outside Munchly's territories. The agent counters anything under the reserve and promises only what Rakesh's calendar can keep. Donation · Mango Drinkmatching partners MF-2410-118 · 22 days leftLakshmi Agencies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Agent timeline Notifie