  "route": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Batches SetupIn a journey · 1 Masala ChipsSettleReports Ledger Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Masala Chips · Route Room Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Awarded at ₹14.20 · 31 of 31 kiranas ordered JourneyRoute Room, doneExecution, donePaperwork, where the batch is 47days leftbest before 18 Nov 2026 Blinkit47/90Zepto47/110Instamart47/1101,360 of 1,840 units at risk · sells 12 a day ConnectonceDetect09:00Verify09:20Value09:21Decide09:22Approve09:40Executeday 0⁠–⁠14Settleday 3⁠–⁠7Reportafter 29 Oct Label, read from the shelf Vision · 09:20 matches the DMS record MUNCHLYMasala Chips 150 gBATCH MF-2409-117MFG 18 MAY 2026BEST BEFORE 18 NOV 2026MRP ₹30.00 incl. of all taxes24 × 150 g Verified · Gemini vision · 0.97 BatchMF-2409-117Manufactured18 May 2026Best before18 Nov 2026Shelf life184 days · 74% usedMRP₹30.00 · 24 × 150 gRecordsmatch Five channels, priced Valuer · 09:21 · per unit, after costs ChartTable Kirana cluster₹17.50ExpireSoon₹15.00Staff sale₹12.00Food bank−₹1.40Write-off−₹19.36 Hover a bar for price, capacity, time to clear and what happens to the GST credit. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit; a donation costs ₹1.40, because the credit on a gift is reversed. Recommended split Router · 09:22 588 · Kirana cluster772 · ExpireSoon 01,360 units at risk 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective (₹21.60 a pack, 2 free with every 10). The best price, and it keeps stock inside Munchly's own trade. Capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days with the scheme, on top of the 12 a day they already sell. 772 units to ExpireSoon at ₹15 (reserve ₹13.50), listed in Rakesh Traders' name and hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories: unlimited depth, 5 to 9 days, the buyer pays freight. The Nagpur staff sale is eligible but pays less a unit than ExpireSoon, so it gets nothing this time. Alternative considered: all 1,360 to ExpireSoon Net ₹20,300: ₹1,470 less, and nothing stays in Munchly's own trade. not chosen If destroyedwrite-off Stock at cost 1,360 × ₹16−₹21,760 GST credit reversed s.17(5)(h) · ₹0.90 a unit−₹1,224 Disposal and transport ₹1.50 a unit, indicative−₹2,040 EPR and waste liability 217.6 kg × ₹6, indicative−₹1,306 Effect on the P&Lminus ₹26,330−₹26,330 If routedrecommended 588 → Kirana cluster at ₹18 effective, 490 charged at ₹21.60₹10,584772 → ExpireSoon at ₹15₹11,580 Van delivery and listing fee −₹394 Net recovered 53% of MRP₹21,770₹21,770 Book cost of the stock sold 1,360 × ₹16−₹21,760 Effect on the P&L+₹10 ₹26,340₹26,340better than destroying it: +₹10 instead of −₹26,330. In cash, the ₹21,770 recovered plus ₹4,570 of credit reversal, disposal and EPR never spent. Approved by Priya · 09:40 · phone Logged with who, when and device. The agents are executing; Rakesh bhai has the same plan in his app. Watch execution Agent timeline Gaps drawn to the clock Watcheragent09:00 Checked 312 batches across 4 distributors. MF-2409-117 fails all three quick-commerce gates and will not sell through. gates.check→Blinkit 47/90 · Zepto 47/110 · Instamart 47/110sellthrough.project→12/day × 40 days = 480 of 1,840pubsub.publish→batch.at_risk Visionagent09:05 Asked Rakesh Traders for one label photo before quoting any price. fcm.send→Rakesh bhai · Hindi Rakesh bhaiperson09:19 Sent one photo of the carton label from shelf B4. Visionagent09:20 Read the label: batch MF-2409-117, MFG 18 May 2026, best before 18 Nov 2026, MRP ₹30.00, confidence 0.97. Matches the DMS record. gemini.vision.read_label→confidence 0.97dms.reconcile→match Valueragent09:21 Priced five channels against 47 days left. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit, −₹26,330 for the batch. bigquery.price_history→snacks · 47 daysgst.rate→HSN 2005 → 5%cost_sheet.input_gst→₹0.90 a packepr.factor→₹6 / kg Routeragent09:22 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective, capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days; 772 to ExpireSoon at ₹15. Th