cies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Agent timeline Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. TodayBatchesLedger ⟨Back to Command Center | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117 | done | done | where the batch is | ExpireSoon request | ExpireSoon response | Units ordered | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | Main⟩",
