  "route": "Command Center Masala Chips · Route Room Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Awarded at ₹14.20 · 31 of 31 kiranas ordered JourneyRoute, doneExecution, donePapers, where the batch is 47days leftbest before 18 Nov 2026 Blinkit47/90Zepto47/110Instamart47/1101,360 of 1,840 units at risk · sells 12 a day Settle8 of 9 · day 3⁠–⁠7 Label, read from the shelf Vision · 09:20 matches the DMS record MUNCHLYMasala Chips 150 gBATCH MF-2409-117MFG 18 MAY 2026BEST BEFORE 18 NOV 2026MRP ₹30.00 incl. of all taxes24 × 150 g Verified · Gemini vision · 0.97 BatchMF-2409-117Manufactured18 May 2026Best before18 Nov 2026Shelf life184 days · 74% usedMRP₹30.00 · 24 × 150 gRecordsmatch Five channels, priced Valuer · 09:21 · per unit, after costs ChartTable Kirana cluster₹17.50ExpireSoon₹15.00Staff sale₹12.00Food bank−₹1.40Write-off−₹19.36 Hover a bar for price, capacity, time to clear and what happens to the GST credit. Destroying costs −₹19.36 a unit; a donation costs ₹1.40, because the credit on a gift is reversed. Recommended split Router · 09:22 588 · Kirana cluster772 · ExpireSoon 01,360 units at risk 588 units to the kirana cluster at ₹18 effective (₹21.60 a pack, 2 free with every 10). The best price, and it keeps stock inside Munchly's own trade. Capped by what 38 kiranas can move in 14 days with the scheme, on top of the 12 a day they already sell. 772 units to ExpireSoon at ₹15 (reserve ₹13.50), listed in Rakesh Traders' name and hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories: unlimited depth, 5 to 9 days, the buyer pays freight. The Nagpur staff sale is eligible but pays less a unit than ExpireSoon, so it gets nothing this time. Alternative considered: all 1,360 to ExpireSoon Net ₹20,300: ₹1,470 less, and nothing stays in Munchly's own trade. not chosen If destroyedwrite-off Stock at cost 1,360 × ₹16−₹21,760 GST credit reversed s.17(5)(h) · ₹0.90 a unit−₹1,224 Disposal and transport ₹1.50 a unit, indicative−₹2,040 EPR and waste liability 217.6 kg × ₹6