72 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. TodayBatchesLedger ⟨Back to Command Center | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117 | done | done | where the batch is | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 47 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Where the batch is: Settle, stage 8 of 9. Show every stage | Carton label on shelf B4: batch MF-2409-117, MFG 18 May 2026, best before 18 Nov 2026, MRP ₹30.00 | View | Net rupees per unit by channel | gates.check → Blinkit 47/90 · Zepto 47/110 · Instamart 47/110 | sellthrough.project → 12/day × 40 days = 480 of 1,840 | pubsub.publish → batch.at_risk | fcm.send → Rakesh bhai · Hindi | gemini.vision.read_label → confidence 0.97 | dms.reconcile → match | bigquery.price_history → snacks · 47 days | gst.rate → HSN 2005 → 5% | cost_sheet.input_gst → ₹0.90 a pack | epr.factor → ₹6 / kg | allocate.greedy → 1,360 units → net ₹21,770 | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 s