  "paperwork": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Batches SetupIn a journey · 1 Masala ChipsReportReports Ledger Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Masala Chips · Paperwork Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Papers ready · ledger next JourneyRoute Room, doneExecution, donePaperwork, doneMF-2409-117 · prepared by the Paperwork agent at the award Rakesh's invoice₹11,510₹11,510 Price support₹8,768₹8,768 GST credit kept₹1,224₹1,224 Things to chase0 Document pack Generated, drafted or not required, each with its reason Exportreviewed drafted Tax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510not required E-way bill check MF-2409-117 · Rakesh Traders ₹11,510₹11,510generated Price-support credit note CN/0117 · Munchly Foods ₹8,768₹8,768generated GST ITC memo s.17(5)(h) · Munchly Foods ₹1,224₹1,224not required FSSAI surplus-food checklist no donation · Munchly Foods Nothing to filenot required Destruction certificate 0 units left · Munchly Foods Nothing to file Who keeps what Rakesh Traders receives₹30,314 and paid 1,360 × ₹22, the van and the fee−₹30,314 He ends whole₹0 Expiry claim Munchly avoids₹34,490 Price support it pays instead−₹8,768 Better for Munchly₹25,722₹25,722 The same ₹25,722 swing as the ledger, seen from Munchly's cash: the ₹22 credit Rakesh would have claimed and the ₹22 he paid cancel out. At plan prices it is ₹8,150 of support and a ₹26,340 swing. Tax invoice Drafted for Rakesh Traders Download PDFTax invoice INV/26-27/0931 · draft · 5 Oct 2026 IGST FromRakesh TradersKalamna Market, Nagpur, MaharashtraGSTIN 27AABCR1234F1Z5 ToAgrawal WholesaleGanj Mandi, Raipur, Chhattisgarh · place of supply 22GSTIN 22AAGFA4821M1Z3 ItemHSNQtyRateTaxableMunchly Masala Chips 150 gBatch MF-2409-117 · best before 18 Nov 20262005772₹14.20₹10,962.40 Taxable value₹10,962.40IGST 5% Maharashtra → Chhattisgarh₹548.00Round off−₹0.40Invoice total₹11,510.00 Drafted by the Paperwork agent for Rakesh Traders to issue from Tally. Chips moved from 12% to 5% GST under GST 2.0 on 22 September 2025. The MRP of ₹30.00 stays printed on every pack: a discounted sale is fine, a second MRP is not (Legal Metrology). ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117, at Report | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Command Center | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117 | done | done | done | Download Tax invoice as a PDF⟩",
