l 200 mlSafe Gupta & Sons · Indore· GL-2410-012 500 days left BlinkitZeptoInstamart Agent activity Every hand-off, as it happens Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. Impactagent30 Oct The return window closed on 29 Oct. Posted the ledger: 217.6 kg diverted, 544 kg CO₂e avoided (indicative), 0 meals. BRSR row written. ledger.post→₹21,152brsr.rows→Principle 6 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Appearance | Appearance | 1 unread notifications | 1 unread notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g | Stages | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | 22 of 180 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 22 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 22 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 22 | 47 of 180 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 47 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 184-day life (110 days), has 47 | Sells out in 48 days; retailers take it for 54 more days | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 61 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 61 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 61 | Sells out in 47 days; retailers take it for 67 more days | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 74 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 74 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 180-day life (108 days), has 74 | Sells out in 50 days; retailers take it for 68 more days | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 75 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 75 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 75 | Sells out in 72 days; retailers take it for 89 more days | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 96 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 96 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 96 | 200 of 270 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 200 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 200 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 270-day life (162 days), has 200 | 460 of 730 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 460 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 730-day life (438 days), has 460 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 730-day life (438 days), has 460 | 500 of 730 days of shelf life left | Blinkit: needs 90+ days, has 500 | Zepto: needs 60% of a 730-day life (438 days), has 500 | Instamart: needs 60% of a 730-day life (438 days), has 500 | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained | ledger.post → ₹21,152 | brsr.rows → Principle 6⟩",
  "approved · priya · execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Batches SetupReports Ledger Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Masala Chips · Execution 1 Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Cleared · 144 packs destroyed at the godown JourneyRoute Room, doneExecution, donePaperwork, doneMF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Lister · ExpireSoonawarded POST /v1/listings { "seller": "Rakesh Traders, Nagpur", "on_behalf": "one-time permission · inside Munchly floors", "sku": "MF-MC-150", "batch": "MF-2409-117", "units": 772, "price": 15.00, "reserve": 13.50, "mrp": 30.00, "best_before": "2026-11-18", "hide_from_pincodes": ["440", "441", "442", "411", "412", "452", "453", "500", "501"], "label_photo": "gs://smart-clearance/labels/MF-2409-117.jpg" }HTTP/1.1 201 Created { "id": "ES-24117", "status": "awarded", "url": "https://expiresoon.example/l/ES-24117" } The marketplace is mocked; the request and response are what a partner API returns. Buyers in Munchly's territories never see the lot. Open on ExpireSoon Outreach · 38 kiranaspush · Hindi नमस्ते Shree Ganesh Kirana! Munchly Masala Chips 150g पर आज खास ऑफर: 10 पैकेट लो, 2 मुफ़्त. Best before 18 Nov 2026. सिर्फ़ 48 घंटे. ऑर्डर के लिए टैप करें — Rakesh Traders 313012345678910123456789 / 38kiranas ordered 588501234567898012345678980123456789 / 588units ItwariMahalSitabuldiSadarDharampethKampteeWardha RoadWardhaKalamna godown Schematic map · not to scale Sainath Kirana Wardha12 11:41Anand General Store Dharampeth24 11:38Vithal Stores Mahal12 11:34 Negotiatorawarded · ₹14.20 Can you do ₹13 for all 772? Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:02 ₹14.20 for 772, Nagpur stock, dispatch within 24 h of balance. Rakesh Traders · Negotiator agent · 11:03 Ok, ₹14.20. Token paid. Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:09 ExpireSoon, planned772 × ₹15.00₹11,580ExpireSoon, actual772 × ₹14.20₹10,962Net, planned₹21,770Net, actual−₹618 on the counter₹21,152 Token ₹1,644 received · balance ₹9,318 plus IGST in 48 h Donation · Mango Drinkpickup confirmed MF-2410-118 · 22 days leftLakshmi Agencies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Expiry settlementDestroyed at the godown Credit to Rakesh Traders₹3,542Destroyed byRakesh TradersOf it: GST and charges₹374 The 144 packs are destroyed at Kalamna Market godown through an authorised agency; Munchly Foods credits Rakesh Traders the dealer price, the GST it reverses and the agency's charges (₹3,542). Open the paper Destruction at the godownapproved BeforeAfter Approved by Priya: the credit note and the agency's certificate are issued. Agent timeline Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. Impactagent30 Oct The return window closed on 29 Oct. Posted the ledger: 217.6 kg diverted, 544 kg CO₂e avoided (indicative), 0 meals. BRSR row written. ledger.post→₹21,152brsr.rows→Principle 6 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Command Center | Appearance | Appearance | 1 unread notifications | 1 unread notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117 | done | done | done | ExpireSoon request | ExpireSoon response | Units ordered | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | The packs at the godown, the batch label in view | The packs slit open at the landfill, the slate in view | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained | ledger.post → ₹21,152 | brsr.rows → Principle 6⟩",
