  "asked again · rakesh · home": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Today Batches Deliveries Label photo Orders Rakesh bhaiDistributor · Rakesh Traders Today Today Rakesh Traders · Kalamna Market godown, Nagpur Smart-Clearance acts for you Inside Munchly's floors · since Thu 16:52 · listings, scheme offers, invoice drafts, dispatch slots Pause 1 batch in a journey Munchly's batches at your godown: what each needs from you, and where each line stands Masala Chips 150 g2 for you MF-2409-117 · 1,360 packs at risk · flagged 2 Oct The batch Destroy 144 expired packs at your godownMunchly asked again: The batch label is not readable in the before photo Send the evidence Issue INV/26-27/0931 from Tally₹11,510 to Agrawal Wholesale, drafted by the Paperwork agent Issue from Tally Kirana scheme588 packets to your kiranas at ₹21.60, 2 free with every 10 delivered on the Tuesday round ExpireSoon lot772 packs on ExpireSoon in your name, the buyer's own truck collected by Agrawal Wholesale's truck Destroyed at the godown144 packs expired at your godown, destroyed there asked again: send the evidence Your other stock and the batches you cleared are on Batches: 1 the Watcher reads, 6 cleared since 1 Jul 2026 ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Rakesh bhai · Distributor · Rakesh Traders | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, batch MF-2409-117⟩",
  "asked · priya · execution": "Smart‑Clearance Munchly Foodsmunchly.smartclearance.com Command Center Batches SetupIn a journey · 1 Masala ChipsReportReports Ledger Priya DeshmukhSupply-chain operator · Munchly Foods Command Center Masala Chips · Execution Masala Chips 150 g MF-2409-117·Rakesh Traders, Nagpur Waiting for Rakesh Traders' destruction evidence JourneyRoute Room, doneExecution, donePaperwork, doneMF-2409-117 · day 0 to 14 · four agents Lister · ExpireSoonawarded POST /v1/listings { "seller": "Rakesh Traders, Nagpur", "on_behalf": "one-time permission · inside Munchly floors", "sku": "MF-MC-150", "batch": "MF-2409-117", "units": 772, "price": 15.00, "reserve": 13.50, "mrp": 30.00, "best_before": "2026-11-18", "hide_from_pincodes": ["440", "441", "442", "411", "412", "452", "453", "500", "501"], "label_photo": "gs://smart-clearance/labels/MF-2409-117.jpg" }HTTP/1.1 201 Created { "id": "ES-24117", "status": "awarded", "url": "https://expiresoon.example/l/ES-24117" } The marketplace is mocked; the request and response are what a partner API returns. Buyers in Munchly's territories never see the lot. Open on ExpireSoon Outreach · 38 kiranaspush · Hindi नमस्ते Shree Ganesh Kirana! Munchly Masala Chips 150g पर आज खास ऑफर: 10 पैकेट लो, 2 मुफ़्त. Best before 18 Nov 2026. सिर्फ़ 48 घंटे. ऑर्डर के लिए टैप करें — Rakesh Traders 313012345678910123456789 / 38kiranas ordered 588501234567898012345678980123456789 / 588units ItwariMahalSitabuldiSadarDharampethKampteeWardha RoadWardhaKalamna godown Schematic map · not to scale Sainath Kirana Wardha12 11:41Anand General Store Dharampeth24 11:38Vithal Stores Mahal12 11:34 Negotiatorawarded · ₹14.20 Can you do ₹13 for all 772? Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:02 ₹14.20 for 772, Nagpur stock, dispatch within 24 h of balance. Rakesh Traders · Negotiator agent · 11:03 Ok, ₹14.20. Token paid. Agrawal Wholesale, Raipur · 11:09 ExpireSoon, planned772 × ₹15.00₹11,580ExpireSoon, actual772 × ₹14.20₹10,962Net, planned₹21,770Net, actual−₹618 on the counter₹21,152 Token ₹1,644 received · balance ₹9,318 plus IGST in 48 h Donation · Mango Drinkpickup confirmed MF-2410-118 · 22 days leftLakshmi Agencies, Hyderabad: 1,372 packs to her kiranas, 150 to her staff sale, 58 left for a food bank. Too few days for ExpireSoon. Feeding India15+ days, 50+ units · volunteer pickup in 48 hmatchesIndia FoodBanking Networkneeds 21+ days and 100+ units58 units The GST credit on donated packs is reversed: section 17(5)(h) blocks it on gifts, and since 1 October 2023 section 17(5)(fa) blocks it on CSR donations too. Expiry settlementDestroyed at the godown Credit to Rakesh Traders₹3,542Destroyed byRakesh TradersOf it: GST and charges₹374 The 144 packs are destroyed at Kalamna Market godown through an authorised agency; Munchly Foods credits Rakesh Traders the dealer price, the GST it reverses and the agency's charges (₹3,542). Open the paper Destruction at the godownwaiting for the evidence Rakesh Traders is asked to destroy the 144 packs at Kalamna Market godown through an authorised agency, and to send two photos and its certificate. Agent timeline Notifieragent09:23 Sent Priya the plan to review, and Rakesh bhai the same plan with a pause button. Priyaperson09:40 Approved the plan from her phone. Listeragent09:41 Posted 772 units on ExpireSoon in Rakesh Traders' name at ₹15, with the label photo and dates. Reserve ₹13.50; hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories. POST /v1/listings→201 · ES-24117 Outreachagent09:41 Pushed the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas in the Nagpur cluster: buy 10 get 2 for 48 hours, no shop over 4× its own 14-day sales. fcm.send→38 kiranas · Hindi DonationagentDay 0 Mango Drink batch: booked Feeding India for 58 units. India FoodBanking Network needs 21+ days and 100+ units. foodbank.match→Feeding India · 58 units Outreachagent11:41 31 of 38 kiranas ordered all 588 units in about two hours, each under its cap. orders.sum→588 units · 31 shops Negotiatoragent11:03 Agrawal Wholesale bid ₹13 for all 772, below the reserve. Countered at ₹14.20 with 24-hour dispatch from Rakesh bhai's calendar. listing.counter→₹13.00 → ₹14.20 Agrawal jiperson11:09 Accepted ₹14.20 and paid the ₹1,644 token. Rakesh bhaipersonMon 5 Oct Loaded Agrawal Wholesale's truck for Raipur once the balance landed. PaperworkagentMon 5 Oct Drafted Rakesh's invoice INV/26-27/0931 for him to issue, checked the e-way bill rule, issued the price-support credit note CN/0117 and wrote the ITC memo. docs.invoice→₹11,510 · drafteway.check→below ₹50,000docs.credit_note→₹8,768itc.memo→₹1,224 retained Rakesh bhaipersonTue 6 Oct Ran the Tuesday round: 31 drops, 588 packets. ⟨Main | Munchly Foods workspace, munchly.smartclearance.com | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117, at Report | Priya Deshmukh · Supply-chain operator · Munchly Foods | Back to Command Center | Appearance | Appearance | Notifications | Notifications | Profile and settings | Masala Chips 150 g, MF-2409-117 | done | done | done | ExpireSoon request | ExpireSoon response | Units ordered | Nagpur cluster: Kalamna godown and 38 kiranas, 31 ordered | POST /v1/listings → 201 · ES-24117 | fcm.send → 38 kiranas · Hindi | foodbank.match → Feeding India · 58 units | orders.sum → 588 units · 31 shops | listing.counter → ₹13.00 → ₹14.20 | docs.invoice → ₹11,510 · draft | eway.check → below ₹50,000 | docs.credit_note → ₹8,768 | itc.memo → ₹1,224 retained⟩",
