  "Approve the plan ₹21,770₹21,770net recovered, 53% of MRP Instead of destroying−₹26,330Swing on this batch₹26,340GST input credit retained₹1,224 What happens the moment you tap Lister posts 772 units on ExpireSoon at ₹15 in Rakesh Traders' name, with the label photo and dates; reserve ₹13.50, hidden from buyers inside Munchly's territories.Outreach pushes the Hindi scheme to 38 kiranas: 588 units at ₹21.60 a pack, 2 free with every 10, for 48 hours.Rakesh bhai gets the same plan in his app and can pause it.Nothing is listed, messaged or shipped before this tap. The approval is logged with who, when and device. Approve · release the agentsNot now ⟨Close | Close⟩",
